    reminderText: After a Predator Catch finishes on-attach effects, optionally deliberately
      release one legal Sardine Bait. Shared one activation per Predator caught.
      Resolve all Release reactions first; then optionally discard hand techniques
      to make room and draw up to two that fit four slots. Removing the activating
      Sardine does not cancel the draw. Decline or failed/prohibited release grants
      no draws. Forced removal and releases by other effects do not activate.
